  "R4" [label="(0,0,0) The programmable quantum current generator addresses the accurate series-connection issue of the Josephson voltage and quantum Hall resistance standards."];
  "R5" [label="(0,0,0) In the earlier programmable quantum current generator implementation, the achieved accuracy relied on corrections of the order of a few parts in 10^7."];
